1
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:52,359
Good morning, my Little Wonders.

2
00:00:57,259 --> 00:00:58,200
Good morning, Grandma!

3
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,150
Who

4
00:01:00,719 --> 00:01:02,600
wants to grow something today?

5
00:01:11,849 --> 00:01:12,750
A bean seed.

6
00:01:17,189 --> 00:01:18,670
Why is it so tiny?

7
00:01:20,109 --> 00:01:23,049
Every big plant starts as a little seed.

8
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:26,150
Just like you, Hoor.

9
00:01:26,969 --> 00:01:27,870
Little now,

10
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:29,329
big one day.

11
00:01:44,909 --> 00:01:48,879
One pot for Zoozoo and Hoor and one for Noonoo

12
00:01:48,929 --> 00:01:49,829
and Nadyah.

13
00:02:01,590 --> 00:02:02,490
Super fast!

14
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,620
I'll

15
00:02:18,099 --> 00:02:19,919
call ours, Sprouty.

16
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,180
What

17
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,620
should we call ours, Hoor?

18
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:25,780
Baby.

19
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:32,229
Now it needs water,

20
00:02:32,909 --> 00:02:34,769
sun, and time.

21
00:02:44,550 --> 00:02:45,669
Is it growing yet?

22
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:51,219
Nadyah, we just planted it.

23
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:57,120
Is it growing yet?

24
00:03:01,329 --> 00:03:03,750
Shh! Baby is sleeping. Let's let her rest.

25
00:03:10,819 --> 00:03:12,319
Why is it taking so long?

26
00:03:13,279 --> 00:03:15,859
I have an idea. Just one little look.

27
00:03:26,890 --> 00:03:28,450
Maybe it needs some rest?

28
00:03:31,829 --> 00:03:32,729
Okay,

29
00:03:33,329 --> 00:03:34,370
one more look tomorrow.

30
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:56,620
Mishoo, is that my slipper?

31
00:04:07,939 --> 00:04:08,980
Is it growing yet?

32
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,379
Grow,

33
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:15,959
baby, grow!

34
00:04:20,479 --> 00:04:21,379
Sprouty?

35
00:04:22,049 --> 00:04:22,949
Hello?

36
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:38,680
Still nothing! Why?

37
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,079
Sprouty sleeps a looong time…

38
00:05:07,230 --> 00:05:08,190
It's not fair!

39
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,800
Sprouty didn't wake up.

40
00:05:15,949 --> 00:05:18,389
Oh, what's the matter, my dears?

41
00:05:19,349 --> 00:05:23,229
Baby grew, but Sprouty didn't. Why?

42
00:05:24,009 --> 00:05:24,910
Hmm,

43
00:05:26,110 --> 00:05:28,689
what does a little seed need to grow?

44
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,740
Water, sun…

45
00:05:37,789 --> 00:05:38,689
and time?

46
00:05:40,450 --> 00:05:43,199
And each time we dig it up, it has to

47
00:05:43,250 --> 00:05:45,070
start all over again.

48
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:50,060
We didn't give it time.

49
00:05:51,210 --> 00:05:53,230
Let's plant a new one, together.

50
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:58,419
Baby!

51
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,899
Big, big sister!

52
00:06:11,530 --> 00:06:12,470
Every morning,

53
00:06:13,149 --> 00:06:14,019
a little water,

54
00:06:14,069 --> 00:06:14,969
one star,

55
00:06:18,110 --> 00:06:19,289
and no digging.

56
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:27,780
No digging,

57
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:29,410
promise.

58
00:06:47,089 --> 00:06:47,990
No digging!

59
00:06:48,859 --> 00:06:49,759
Star!

60
00:06:51,209 --> 00:06:52,470
You're right, Hoor!

61
00:07:14,930 --> 00:07:17,250
Sprouty, Sprouty is awake!

62
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,879
We waited and it grew.

63
00:07:27,500 --> 00:07:29,300
Hi, little sister!

64
00:07:31,609 --> 00:07:34,329
Good things grow when we wait.

65
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Little hearts, big wonders!
